<p></p><b>Question 30</b>
 asks you to describe the 
     current level of lending standards at your bank relative to the range of standards that 
     has prevailed between 2005 and the present. For each of the loan categories 
     listed below, please consider the points at which standards at your bank were tightest 
      and easiest 
      during this period.  
